data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":1883,"response":{"id":"resp_05ead64b871aca2a016adb6508dccc8191b506479f8d8798d2","object":"response","created_at":1792763145,"completed_at":1792763166,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through structured submit_draft (preferred) or the compatible submit_artifact wrapper. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_05ead64b871aca2a016adb650e1f0c8191b942c66d8f1dc1f1","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq22UOAwsE2fjyy4hHfaqIM6rMFNq6PtvgJFM6tgQaf25UL6aeKVRcyXtsT98nzIJVAS1OYolywtWgsFt43bAm_JZF6Pgxr8y4yF3eUNfXLvp3wjhstYGOcFcoz2vdbLsC-yDTy6fqc8V018XxiDVv57U_euk3uXaiiZ1pOimpyNbvCJMAQ8-Ex1SX6W4x-fgH9qnPHrkRhJxXldTdqHZBHrNM6TJvlcuFi6CLq0pDvsGnjg3xLR1vXUUdX3JSoJzzud_D1i5JiDIa5aOiCkL8rfSfrGFc6V0lIRUnGb5P3prXPQjXy8jrXkHTc8QcQZaQLvsC89-iHIfTlSE4s_A4lo_QYz9oQlFglI6953ydTGCaz5OitfQ3toRwU_sxPW7fHF31ySrm-r7XAGQwxX_nQprpu3Pg1fJEwTYKQcIu667yMOCQJbLKkrXxACbO1re9VBrnr3PWaFuN7JWp0mxhiSIielpcnsKjd-h2dJBvlXVVBNosarfcSfqEmlmF0rgaLeYoKPPKsG8uNFaixKZXTm_VCqaEmrkFI5Qg_1JKNZH_iFNpr5Hl1GVSBdN6Oguo5QtIxMXURFXV418llDb66vwoBrCqoq28qeoTJjLRnBol_rq6q3ZI5REqwXIJsobqtUZLZjnFdI-bcBffpdQrqLgCG9bHazOFXgw-osr6suS5blAY7NM-GiZq4p4ssIfbU6eeKYO5zYpqb_ShtZIC_SnXBJot50JSlVQCtxM8qPo7zc7j_fdcWyrkDXgRFzU0uhM8l8DgxGIlC-F5PW4-om0MqJZuy9fu-uErxFJ9SR5kuR2ppZNG4h4BwTW0ive45q5XZwTzhEiFiILjehtiRNDo4Yhlqr5-9rqudfuEKwGDc_EvhzdsFILkIJnv-qYuYvJKRCOcvKOCHLtOHdcbbGrIEe3ovVEgsxBWMS3Rg89nhjh7kSRZQ0MWn_NU842WjNVpF1Bmrebitu_EZgOjfpoWI3sng